{
  "$schema": "../../../schema/plugin.schema.json",
  "id": "workflow-operator.circle",
  "name": "弈友圈关系算子",
  "type": "plugin",
  "pointId": "workflow-operator",
  "specVersion": 1,
  "entry": "call",
  "code": "plugins/workflow-operator/circle/index.js",
  "origin": "manual",
  "intent": "用户想分析某个野狐账号的弈友圈：看它最近跟谁下棋、同时也看看对手的交战对手，由模型依据可复算的对阵计数与图结构归纳圈层、枢纽、游离账号与共同对手。本插件只做纯计算投影（stats / nodes / components / edges / commonOpponents），零网络、零时钟、零随机数，不含任何「达到几局算熟人」之类的阈值判定；取数由宿主内置算子 foxwq_fetch_batch 完成，关系结论由 LLM 给出并附数据理由。",
  "readme": "plugins/workflow-operator/circle/README.md",
  "license": "MIT",
  "tags": [
    "workflow-operator",
    "circle",
    "foxwq",
    "graph",
    "normalize"
  ],
  "category": "围棋",
  "exposes": [
    {
      "name": "normalize",
      "description": "把 foxwq_fetch_batch 取回的紧凑对局行投影成可复算的关系事实。入参 {games:[紧凑对局行], rootUid:字符串}；返回 {stats, nodes, components, edges, commonOpponents}：stats 为 rootUid / 去重局数 / 节点数 / 边数 / 除 root 外账号数，nodes[] 每项 {uid,name,dan,degree,gameCount}，components[] 为无向图连通分量 {size,members}，edges[] 为按对合并的 {a,aName,b,bName,games,aWins,bWins,lastTime}，commonOpponents[] 为 {uid,name,shared,gamesWithRoot}。只出计数与图结构，绝不判定圈层/熟人/枢纽；所有排序与口径确定，可逐字段复算，见同目录 README.md。",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "games",
          "rootUid"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "games": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "宿主内置算子 foxwq_fetch_batch 的 value.games[]：紧凑对局行，含 chessid / blackuid / blacknick / blackdan / whiteuid / whitenick / whitedan / starttime / winner 等字段；按 chessid 去重。",
            "items": {
              "type": "object"
            }
          },
          "rootUid": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "foxwq_fetch_batch 的 value.rootUid：主账号 uid（字符串），共同对手与直接对局数都以它为基准。"
          }
        }
      },
      "outputSchema": {},
      "kind": "pure",
      "idempotent": true
    }
  ],
